{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","阿德"],["/names/en","Odie"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长持续作战的射手，能对对手造成持续伤害。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Marksman who is skilled at war of attrition and dealing continuous damage."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","又到了上工的时候了？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Ugh, time for work again?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哇哦，没有涨薪水的升职。谢谢了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Wow, a promotion! Without the salary increase! Thanks so much..."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","嘿，尝尝这个！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Hey, try this! Hahahahah!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","失算了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Didn't anticipate this, ugh..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","一点儿经验，加一点儿运气。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Mweheheh, a bit of experience, a bit of luck."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","暗箭伤人有什么不好？多安全啊。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Hohohoh, what's wrong with a good sneak attack? As long as I'm safe!"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，日安，头儿。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Oh! Good day, boss."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","抓到了，舒服呀。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Safe? Safe. Well, still safe."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","安全，安全，还是安全。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","*Yawn* What did you say? I'll do my job, I will."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","从哪里搞到的？真有你的！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Where'd you get that?! You're incredible!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喔，有趣的小玩意。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Huh, neat little gizmo..."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","蚀骨流箭"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Desert Defender"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","漫不经心的吹箭，轻描淡写的毒液，不容小觑的危险。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Silent yet lethal, blowgun and poison never fail their master, and they show no mercy to those who underestimate their power."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","沙原斥候"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Desert Ranger"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","在这片残酷无情的沙海中，浅色的毛发与凉爽轻便的甲胄，往往意味着更多的生存机会。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","The color of the fur blends seamlessly with the desert sands, and the lightweight armor provides essential protection while keeping the wearer cool. It all makes survival in this harsh environment much easier."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","外观商城购买可得该皮肤。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Purchase at Cosmetics."],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","偷懒？这叫合理安排"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Slacking off? This is called time management!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","还有的是时间呢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","There's still plenty of time."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噢，我要续杯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Oh, I need a refill!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇噢，节日装饰！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Look at these holiday decorations!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日有休假吧？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","The holiday's here! I should get a day off, right?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","灯笼棒极了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These lanterns are incredible!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","希望有节日加薪！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Will I get a holiday bonus?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","活在当下是阿德的座右铭。他的另一句谚语是：早做准备。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Odie lives by two sayings: \"Always live in the moment\" and \"Always be prepared.\""],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","阿德也有失手的时刻。那时候，不反抗是最好的选择。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Odie also has moments of failure. In times like this, the path of non-resistance is the best option."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","阿德最喜欢吃肉排。但如果你愿意请他吃饭，那么他最喜欢吃白食。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Odie loves steak, but his favorite kind of meal is one that someone else pays for. \"That blasted hyena still owes me five gold from the last time we ate.\" —Kruger"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿德其实有存款，但他不愿告诉别人。因为秘密是无法被掠夺的。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Odie actually has a decent amount of savings, but he refuses to tell anyone. According to him, secrets are less likely to be stolen."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","阿德喜欢剪报。无论是新闻、笑话，或知识。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Odie enjoys taking newspaper clippings from different cities in Esperia—from news and editorials to comic strips and jokes."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","逃过仇人的子弹时，阿德时常想，自己究竟是幸运，还是罪不至此？"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","After avoiding the projectiles of his enemies, Odie often wondered if he was lucky or if his sins were justified."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","阿德的尾巴相当灵活，甚至可以执笔写字，和商户讨价还价时，他常趁主顾不注意时用尾巴篡改标价。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Odie has a prehensile tail that can even hold a pen to write. When bargaining with merchants, he makes use of his skills to tamper with price tags while no one is looking."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","曾有人委托阿德运送十块鸡翅，送到时，阿德宣称鸡翅运来的路上遭遇了强盗，自己勉力抢回五块。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Odie once worked at a courier service called HustleHut and was sent to deliver some chicken wings to a customer. He claimed that a bandit accosted him along the way, and in the end, he was only able to save half of the customer's order."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","阿德偶尔也会回想起自己的家庭，父亲，还有父亲的谏言，但那些记忆在咸水镇的风沙中已经有些模糊。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Odie's thoughts sometimes turn to his home and to his father's advice. Unfortunately, the sands and winds of Alkali have already blurred most of those memories."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿德也兼职做向导，小费给足，他会尽力保你平安。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Odie works as a guide from time to time. For a generous tip, he'll make sure that you won't get robbed, killed, or kidnapped in the Ashen Wastes. \"It's not easy to stay alive out here, but you've got a friend in me.\" —Odie"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，瓦尔克老兄！我猜你们坐在这里太过无聊，所以过来凑个热闹，还有位置吧？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Walker! You must be bored sitting here doing nothing. Mind if I join you for a moment?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412060.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412060.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Odie & Walker"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","等一下，你不能拿走我的水壶，那里面可是我从集市淘换来的好水，一点沙子都没掺。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Wait! Don't take my bottle. I got this delicious water from the market. It doesn't have a single grain of sand."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412150.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 满满 & 瓦尔克 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Odie & Chippy & Walker & Satrana"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Oh no, what to do with these herbs?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415012.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 阿熏和蒙蒙"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Odie & Smokey & Meerky"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","偷懒？这叫合理安排"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Slacking off? This is called time management!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415090.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415090.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Odie"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","噢，我要续杯！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Oh, I need a refill!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415091.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415091.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Odie"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","阿德，我的名字——很高兴认识你！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","Odie's my name. Nice to meet you!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415326.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415326.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","阿德 & 卢卡"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Odie & Lucca"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哇噢，节日装饰！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Look at these holiday decorations!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415399.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415399.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Odie"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","节日有休假吧？"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","The holiday's here! I should get a day off, right?"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415400.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415400.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Odie"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","灯笼棒极了！"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","These lanterns are incredible!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415571.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415571.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Odie"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","希望有节日加薪！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","Will I get a holiday bonus?"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415572.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415572.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","阿德"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Odie"]]}